From: DaffyDabz <daffydabz@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 19:13:36 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 028/371] quests: the Isla Cangrejos chest of tt2.2recoverGold
 gets its treasure list

IC_CHEST_8 (1175041664.0dxschafe5) is a real buried chest on Isla Cangrejos, but TreasureDefs had no entry for it, so
every dig for tt2.2recoverGold was refused. Found by checking all 66 dig and search quests against the world data; it
is the only one whose target could never be found. Shared file: the client needs it too (the quest beam reads it).
---
 pirates/quest/QuestConstants.py | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/pirates/quest/QuestConstants.py b/pirates/quest/QuestConstants.py
index 557bcb9..27359a7 100644
--- a/pirates/quest/QuestConstants.py
+++ b/pirates/quest/QuestConstants.py
@@ -808,6 +808,7 @@ class TreasureIds:
         CT_CHEST_1: (CT_CHEST_1,),
         DW_CHESTS: (DW_CHEST_1, DW_CHEST_2, DW_CHEST_3, DW_CHEST_4, DW_CHEST_5, DW_CHEST_6, DW_CHEST_7, DW_CHEST_8, DW_CHEST_9, DW_CHEST_10),
         IC_CHEST_1: (IC_CHEST_1,),
+        IC_CHEST_8: (IC_CHEST_8,),
         IC_CHEST_9: (IC_CHEST_9,),
         IC_CHEST_11: (IC_CHEST_11,),
         IC_CHESTS: (IC_CHEST_1, IC_CHEST_2, IC_CHEST_3, IC_CHEST_4, IC_CHEST_5, IC_CHEST_6, IC_CHEST_7, IC_CHEST_8, IC_CHEST_9, IC_CHEST_10),
